<div class="musiki-pod" data-pod="orf" data-pod-title="ORF" data-orf-section>
  <div class="conference-sidebar-panel-body conference-sidebar-panel-body--chat conference-orf-panel">
    <div class="conference-chat" data-orf-scroller>
      <ul class="conference-chat-list conference-orf-list" data-orf-list>
        <li class="conference-chat-item conference-orf-empty" data-orf-empty>
          <div class="conference-chat-header">
            <span class="conference-chat-author">Orf</span>
            <span class="conference-chat-header-separator">·</span>
            <span class="conference-chat-stamp">local</span>
          </div>
          <div class="conference-chat-text">
            Preguntame algo de la clase. Puedo preparar una propuesta para LILY-CODE, NOTAS, chat o HYPERPIANO.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="conference-chat-compose-anchor">
      <div class="conference-orf-contextbar">
        <select class="musiki-pod-input conference-orf-model" data-orf-model aria-label="Modelo Orf">
          <option value="">modelo por defecto</option>
          <option value="deepseek-r1:8b">deepseek-r1:8b</option>
          <option value="qwen2.5:7b-instruct">qwen2.5 (7b)</option>
          <option value="llama3.2">llama3.2</option>
        </select>
        <span class="conference-orf-scope" data-orf-scope>contexto: clase</span>
      </div>

      <div class="conference-chat-compose">
        <textarea
          rows="3"
          name="orf"
          placeholder="Preguntale a Orf"
          data-orf-input></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="musiki-pod-toolbar">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="musiki-pod-btn musiki-pod-btn--accent conference-chat-send"
          data-action="orf-send"
          aria-label="Preguntar a Orf"
          title="Preguntar a Orf"
          disabled
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16">
            <path
              d="M3.4 11.2 19.8 4.3c.8-.3 1.7.4 1.5 1.2l-2.7 13.3c-.2 1-1.5 1.2-2 .4l-3.3-4.7-4.8-.5c-1-.1-1.2-1.5-.3-2l11.6-6.8-12.9 5 1.2 2.3c.3.7-.2 1.5-1 1.4l-3.2-.3c-.9-.1-1.2-1.4-.5-1.8Z"
              fill="currentColor"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          class="musiki-pod-btn conference-orf-clear"
          data-action="orf-clear"
          aria-label="Limpiar Orf"
          title="Limpiar"
          disabled
        >C</button>

        <button
          type="button"
          class="musiki-pod-btn"
          data-action="orf-testh"
          style="font-size: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.6;"
          title="Test HYPERPIANO"
        >TH</button>

        <div class="musiki-pod-status conference-orf-status" data-orf-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="conference-orf-reasoning" data-orf-reasoning hidden></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .musiki-pod[data-pod="orf"] {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .conference-orf-panel {
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .conference-orf-empty .conference-chat-author {
    color: var(--conference-accent, #76d3ff);
  }

  .conference-orf-contextbar {
    align-items: center;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0 0 0.35rem;
  }

  .conference-orf-model {
    min-width: 0;
    width: 9.5rem;
  }

  .conference-orf-scope {
    color: var(--conference-muted);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  :global(.conference-orf-actions) {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  :global(.conference-orf-action) {
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    height: 1.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 0 0.45rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .conference-orf-status {
    max-width: 45%;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .conference-orf-reasoning {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    opacity: 0.4;
    max-height: 1.8rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    flex: 1;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border-radius: 2px;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .conference-orf-reasoning::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
</style>
